# Carelune Neuro Continuum — demonstration prototype.
#
# This folder is the Carelune app root, but it ALSO contains three unrelated
# projects and some large binaries. Everything below is excluded so a GitHub
# repo for Carelune stays Carelune-only.
#
# Before your first push, sanity-check with:  git status --short
# If anything below appears in that list, stop and fix this file first.

# --- Dependencies and build output (Netlify builds these itself) ---
node_modules/
dist/

# --- Unrelated projects that happen to live in this folder (~2.2 GB) ---
# NOTE: this is a blacklist, so a NEW unrelated folder dropped in here will not
# be ignored automatically. Re-check `git status --short` before every push.
cyrix-discovery/
airliquide-ocr/
why-continuum-care/
joy/
CYRIX_LIVE_DISCOVERY/
CYRIX_LIVE_DISCOVERY_FROZEN_SPEC.zip
*.zip

# --- Source attachments / pitch material — not part of the demo ---
Continuum-Pitch.pdf
Continuum-Pitch.pptx
*.pptx
*.key

# --- Local environment and secrets — must never be committed ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key.json
.netlify/

# --- OS and editor noise ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# --- Local session/scratch state ---
.claude/settings.local.json
